docs {
  Follow-ups the front lanes found (F18.5): the metrics board lists «Aceptar puntaje original» (RE-9) once the
  nightly job stored it, and every `ticket_itop_id` a response gives (recommendations, ticket log, error queue) is
  the numeric iTop id the filters and the feedback take, or null (demo tickets, DEMO-n). They only read, so the
  folder runs any number of times.
}
